@startuml domain
title Validez - Domain model (v2)

' ===== Structură arbore =====
class TreeNode {
  id (ULID)
  parent_id
  path (ltree)
  name
  type
  position
  created_by
  created_at
}

' ===== Conținut civic =====
class CivicSubject {
  id
  node_id
  type (ISSUE/PROPOSAL/PROJECT/\nPROMISE/ELECTORAL_EVALUATION/\nPETITION/TOPIC_EVALUATION)
  title
  description
  status
  author_id
  created_at
  updated_at
}

class MediaAsset {
  id
  subject_id
  type (image/gallery/video/pdf/link)
  url
  caption
}

class Location {
  id
  subject_id
  latitude
  longitude
  judet
  localitate
}

class Authority {
  id
  subject_id
  name
  role
  contact
}

class Comment {
  id
  subject_id
  user_id
  parent_id
  content
  status
  created_at
  updated_at
}

class Flag {
  id
  user_id
  target_type (SUBJECT/COMMENT/\nMEDIA/USER)
  target_id
  reason
  description
  status
  created_at
  resolved_at
  resolved_by
}

' ===== Vot =====
class VoteType {
  id
  code (VALIDITY/YES_NO/IMPORTANCE...)
  name
  configuration
}

class SubjectVoteType {
  subject_id
  vote_type_id
  enabled
  configuration
}

class Vote {
  id
  subject_id
  user_id
  vote_type_id
  value
  created_at
  updated_at
  signature
}

class VoteEvent {
  id
  vote_id
  type (Created/Changed/Revoked)
  previous_hash
  hash
  created_at
}

class VoteAggregate {
  subject_id
  vote_type_id
  total_votes
  score
  updated_at
}

class VoteResult {
  subject_id
  vote_type_id
  value
  count
  percentage
}

' ===== Utilizator =====
class User {
  id
  email
  provider (email/google/facebook/apple)
  displayName
  publicKey
  emailVerified
  phoneVerified
  trustScore
  createdAt
}

' ===== Trust score / anti-Sybil (ADR-0004) =====
class TrustScoreCalculation {
  id
  user_id
  score
  trust_score_version
  config_commit
  calculated_at
}

class TrustConfigSnapshot {
  id
  git_commit
  config_hash
  algorithm_version
  deployed_at
  deployed_by
  environment
}

class SecurityOverride {
  id
  parameter
  old_value
  new_value
  reason
  created_by
  created_at
  expires_at
  approved_by
}

' ===== Relații =====
TreeNode "1" -- "*" TreeNode : parent_id (arbore)
TreeNode "1" -- "*" CivicSubject : conținut asociat

CivicSubject "1" -- "*" MediaAsset
CivicSubject "1" -- "0..1" Location
CivicSubject "1" -- "*" Authority
CivicSubject "1" -- "*" Comment
CivicSubject "1" -- "*" SubjectVoteType

SubjectVoteType "*" -- "1" VoteType
CivicSubject "1" -- "*" Vote
VoteType "1" -- "*" Vote
User "1" -- "*" Vote

Vote "1" -- "*" VoteEvent : hash chain
CivicSubject "1" -- "*" VoteAggregate
CivicSubject "1" -- "*" VoteResult

User "1" -- "*" Comment
User "1" -- "*" Flag

User "1" -- "*" TrustScoreCalculation : istoric scoruri
TrustScoreCalculation "*" -- "1" TrustConfigSnapshot : calculat pe baza

note right of Vote
  UNIQUE (subject_id, user_id, vote_type_id)
  — un user poate avea un singur vot activ
  per (subiect, tip de vot), dar îl poate schimba.
end note

note right of TreeNode
  Structura pură a arborelui.
  Nu conține conținut votabil direct —
  acesta trăiește în CivicSubject.
end note

note bottom of VoteEvent
  MVP: hash chain simplu
  (previous_hash -> hash).
  Faza 2: agregare într-un Merkle Tree
  + witness servers (vezi security.puml).
end note

note bottom of TrustScoreCalculation
  TrustScore e o valoare calculată,
  nu un adevăr static persistat și
  mutabil. Fiecare calcul e legat
  explicit de config_commit — vezi
  ADR-0004.
end note

note bottom of SecurityOverride
  Orice override runtime al
  configurației e explicit, temporar,
  auditat (created_by/approved_by/
  expires_at) — niciodată tăcut.
end note

@enduml
